      {
        "name": "The Text Twin Rule",
        "body": "Bright plate colours are for rings, bars, fills and icons. Words in those colours use the `*-text` twin, never the bright fill colour on white.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Iron Main Action Rule",
